@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title SVG 编辑器 CLI — 模块与依赖方向

package "cli（最外层）" {
  [Repl]
  [main / composition root]
}

package "app（用例编排）" {
  [CommandRunner]
  [EditorSession]
}

package "commands（Command 模式）" {
  [CommandRegistry]
  [CommandHistory]
  [18 个 *Command 类]
}

package "domain（核心，零依赖）" {
  [Shape]
  [Group\n«Composite»]
  [Rect / Circle /\nEllipse / Line / Text]
  [SvgDocument]
  [ShapeFactory]
  [DocumentMemento]
}

package "io（格式与文件）" {
  [SvgCodec]
  [SvgDecoder / SvgEncoder]
  [SvgXmlReader]
  [NodeFileGateway]
}

package "presentation（文本视图）" {
  [TreeRenderer]
  [ShowRenderer]
}

package "shared（端口与基建）" {
  [EditorError]
  [Tokenizer / Arguments]
  [FileGateway «port»]
  [DocumentCodec «port»]
}

main / composition root --> Repl
main / composition root --> EditorSession
main / composition root --> SvgCodec
main / composition root --> NodeFileGateway
Repl --> CommandRunner
CommandRunner --> CommandRegistry
CommandRunner --> CommandHistory
CommandRunner --> EditorSession
EditorSession ..|> CommandContext
18 个 *Command 类 --> Shape
18 个 *Command 类 --> CommandHistory
SvgCodec ..|> DocumentCodec
NodeFileGateway ..|> FileGateway
SvgDecoder --> ShapeFactory
TreeRenderer --> Shape
ShowRenderer --> Shape
Group --> Shape
SvgDocument --> Shape

note right of commands
  依赖方向：commands 只依赖 domain 与端口，
  不 import io / app / cli —— 因此图中
  commands 与 io 之间没有箭头。
end note

note bottom of domain
  domain 不依赖任何上层模块；
  这是整个架构的依赖汇点。
end note

@enduml
